Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.4.22) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(functions/network): make isValidHostIpv4() subnet-aware - the
     octet-based .0/.255 "network"/"broadcast" heuristic was only correct
     by coincidence for /24 subnets, wrongly rejecting or accepting host
     addresses in larger or smaller subnets (#205, 9b94731).
